      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Mobile and Montgomery Railroad ran through Castleberry in the 1860s, cementing the town’s name and boosting its growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
